      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3ce5d5f34c9ef795189ab263182d87e48ffb150b037bdb53ef32938dc60dd05a"
      ],
      "text": "The concept is team-based agent collaboration: a leader is chosen for each step, the leader creates an action plan, and team members work together to complete each task."
    },
